OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the station cat whose book
OL,4,Awon hearts globally
OL,5,
OL,6,FA railway cat who became an online
OL,7,Fsensation has added another milestone
OL,8,Fto his growing list of achievements
OL,9,Fwith the release of a book about his
OL,10,Flife.
OL,12,FGeorge, the Stourbridge Junction cat,
OL,13,Fhas amassed around 260,000 followers
OL,14,Facross different social media
OL,15,Fplatforms.
OL,17,FHis fame reached beyond the internet
OL,18,Flast year, when a West Midlands Railway
OL,19,Ftrain, which runs between Stourbridge
OL,20,FTown and Stourbridge Junction, was
OL,21,Fnamed after him. A song has also been
OL,22,Fwritten about the feline celebrity.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
