OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the station cat whose book
OL,4,Awon hearts globally
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, service quality and continuous
OL,7,Fimprovement manager, Simone Carter, has
OL,8,Fpublished an autobiography about
OL,9,FGeorge, bringing together his story and
OL,10,Fthe impact he has had on the local
OL,11,Fcommunity.
